<section id="who">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Who reads this</div>
    <h2>Built for people who underwrite reality</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Investors</h3>
        <p>Inspect the named developers, offtakers and equipment in published records. Missing participants remain unknown.</p>
        <div class="mono-list">GEV · BE · WMB · ET · CAT · SEI</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Suppliers</h3>
        <p>Follow equipment and permit changes in your target projects. A filing can identify participants; it does not establish that a supply contract is still available.</p>
        <div class="mono-list">OEM sales · midstream · EPC</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Developers &amp; lenders</h3>
        <p>Inspect source documents, compare documented equipment and explore power-cost assumptions. Exact operating dates and project economics require their own evidence.</p>
        <div class="mono-list">infra funds · private credit · insurers</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Journalists &amp; researchers</h3>
        <p>Numbers you can print, with the government document one click away on every row. CC BY 4.0 — quote freely, chart freely, just credit the source.</p>
        <div class="mono-list">newsrooms · academics · policy analysts</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
